+# Task HS-UX-01
+
+- Root cause 1: frontend and backend were not running together consistently.
+- Root cause 2: local admin password was not fixed because `DEFAULT_ADMIN_PASSWORD` was unset.
+- Root cause 3: HSCode page used only the search endpoint and had no default list mode.
+- Root cause 4: the actual DB file is `backend/prisma/dev.db`; the top-level `backend/dev.db` is not the runtime DB.
+- Verification:
+  - backend HSCode service test passed
+  - frontend HSCode service/page tests passed
+  - frontend `/login` returned 200
+  - backend login API returned 200 with seeded admin user
